# This directory holds the AUTHORITATIVE database schema history.
#
# Phase 0 intentionally contains NO migration files — it establishes the
# foundation (PostgreSQL, the runner, the API, Electron) before any schema or
# payroll-domain complexity exists.
#
# Phase 1 will add, in order:
#   0001_extensions.sql
#   0002_core_functions.sql
#   0003_nodes.sql
#   0004_users.sql
#   0005_employees.sql
#   0006_outbox.sql
#   0007_sync_cursor.sql
#
# RULES (see README.md):
#   - These .sql files are the single source of truth for the schema.
#   - They are applied by our own runner (apps/api/src/db/migrate.ts), NOT by
#     `drizzle-kit push` (which is banned) and NOT by drizzle's migrator.
#   - Numbered NNNN_name.sql, applied in lexical order, up-only.
#   - A migration that has been merged is immutable; fix forward with a new
#     migration instead of editing history.
#
# This placeholder exists only because git does not track empty directories.
